/E (Launched by IBM in 2010, the Innovation Centre for Education \(IBM ICE\) is a transformative initiative bridging the gap between academia and industry. IBM ICE programs equip students with cutting-edge, industry-aligned skills in high-demand technology domains. Emphasizing hands-on, project-based learning and adherence to NEP norms, IBM ICE cultivates future-ready professionals prepared for the dynamic job market.)
