<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The rise of Generative AI and Foundation Models \(e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini\) has created a new frontier in every industry. This isn't just another technology; it's a new kind of collaborator. The most successful professionals will be those who can direct this powerful intelligence with precision and purpose. The key to unlocking this potential is not found in code, but in communication.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This is where prompt engineering becomes the essential skill of our time. Just as Vygotsky emphasized the Zone of Proximal Development \(ZPD\) to show how expert guidance can elevate a learner's ability, our program teaches you to act as that expert guide for AI. By scaffolding complex tasks into clear instructions, you can unlock capabilities that were once out of reach. By mastering this cognitive bridge between human intent and machine output, this certificate program empowers learners to engage AI systems intelligently, ethically, and creatively, turning abstract potential into concrete professional advantages.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
endobj
